{"id": "CDX-04", "title": "Codex documentation import task", "transcript": "ai-documentation/archive/cdx-04-codex-01a10c5f-6044-73c2-afde-17d95bf1e068-transcript.txt", "sha256": "0748a5e667b61ab2d6a69eada4f7f687d5b3a40c2be6d9e1688efdd0248b85d0", "kind": "communication_archive", "lines": [{"number": 8, "text": "MESSAGE 0001 | 2026-10-05T14:03:03.381Z | USER | PROMPT", "id": "CDX-04-L000008", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0001", "message_start": true, "message_role": "user"}, {"number": 9, "text": "[https://chatgpt.com/share/6ac3ade6-d438-83ed-bf84-1f0a897128e3](https://chatgpt.c", "id": "CDX-04-L000009", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0001", "message_start": false, "message_role": "user"}, {"number": 10, "text": "om/share/6ac3ade6-d438-83ed-bf84-1f0a897128e3)", "id": "CDX-04-L000010", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0001", "message_start": false, "message_role": "user"}, {"number": 11, "text": "[https://chatgpt.com/share/6ac3adf1-b5cc-83eb-9248-acf4961d6272](https://chatgpt.c", "id": "CDX-04-L000011", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0001", "message_start": false, "message_role": "user"}, {"number": 12, "text": "om/share/6ac3adf1-b5cc-83eb-9248-acf4961d6272)", "id": "CDX-04-L000012", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0001", "message_start": false, "message_role": "user"}, {"number": 13, "text": "[https://chatgpt.com/share/6ac3adfb-dfc0-83eb-a116-93a33686fb9c](https://chatgpt.c", "id": "CDX-04-L000013", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0001", "message_start": false, "message_role": "user"}, {"number": 14, "text": "om/share/6ac3adfb-dfc0-83eb-a116-93a33686fb9c)", "id": "CDX-04-L000014", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0001", "message_start": false, "message_role": "user"}, {"number": 15, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000015", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0001", "message_start": false, "message_role": "user"}, {"number": 16, "text": "&#x20;Kannst du bitte diese Konversation mit in die KI-Dokumentation für meine", "id": "CDX-04-L000016", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0001", "message_start": false, "message_role": "user"}, {"number": 17, "text": "Masterarbeit mit aufnehmen?", "id": "CDX-04-L000017", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0001", "message_start": false, "message_role": "user"}, {"number": 18, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000018", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0001", "message_start": false, "message_role": "user"}, {"number": 19, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000019", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0001", "message_start": false, "message_role": "user"}, {"number": 20, "text": "MESSAGE 0002 | 2026-10-05T14:03:07.562Z | ASSISTANT | COMMENTARY", "id": "CDX-04-L000020", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0002", "message_start": true, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 21, "text": "Ich prüfe die drei verlinkten Gespräche und die bestehende KI-Dokumentation und", "id": "CDX-04-L000021", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0002", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 22, "text": "ergänze sie im vorhandenen Format.", "id": "CDX-04-L000022", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0002", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 23, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000023", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0002", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 24, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000024", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0002", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 25, "text": "MESSAGE 0003 | 2026-10-05T14:04:01.470Z | ASSISTANT | COMMENTARY", "id": "CDX-04-L000025", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0003", "message_start": true, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 26, "text": "Die Dokumentation enthält bereits nummerierte Gesprächsarchive und zitierbare", "id": "CDX-04-L000026", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0003", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 27, "text": "Seiten- und Zeilenverweise. Ich ergänze die drei Gespräche als neue Archive und", "id": "CDX-04-L000027", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0003", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 28, "text": "aktualisiere anschließend die PDF samt Verweisen.", "id": "CDX-04-L000028", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0003", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 29, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000029", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0003", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 30, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000030", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0003", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 31, "text": "MESSAGE 0004 | 2026-10-05T14:04:16.070Z | ASSISTANT | COMMENTARY", "id": "CDX-04-L000031", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0004", "message_start": true, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 32, "text": "Für die Prüfung der aktualisierten PDF nutze ich den PDF-Skill; dabei kontrolliere", "id": "CDX-04-L000032", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0004", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 33, "text": "ich auch die Darstellung der neuen Gesprächsanhänge.", "id": "CDX-04-L000033", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0004", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 34, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000034", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0004", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 35, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000035", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0004", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 36, "text": "MESSAGE 0005 | 2026-10-05T14:05:44.912Z | ASSISTANT | COMMENTARY", "id": "CDX-04-L000036", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0005", "message_start": true, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 37, "text": "Die drei Links enthalten insgesamt 220 sichtbare Nachrichten: zwei kurze", "id": "CDX-04-L000037", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0005", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 38, "text": "Überarbeitungen und ein längeres Gespräch zu Einleitung, Surface, Interaction,", "id": "CDX-04-L000038", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0005", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 39, "text": "Operation und Schluss. Alle drei lassen sich archivieren; in den Shares sind keine", "id": "CDX-04-L000039", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0005", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 40, "text": "fehlenden Anhänge ausgewiesen.", "id": "CDX-04-L000040", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0005", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 41, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000041", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0005", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 42, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000042", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0005", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 43, "text": "MESSAGE 0006 | 2026-10-05T14:27:08.802Z | ASSISTANT | COMMENTARY", "id": "CDX-04-L000043", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0006", "message_start": true, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 44, "text": "Die Gespräche sind aufgenommen und die PDF ist neu gebaut. Ich prüfe jetzt, ob", "id": "CDX-04-L000044", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0006", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 45, "text": "alle Archivzeilen vollständig in der PDF stehen, und aktualisiere die", "id": "CDX-04-L000045", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0006", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 46, "text": "Seitenverweise für die neue Ausgabe.", "id": "CDX-04-L000046", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0006", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 47, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000047", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0006", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}, {"number": 48, "text": "", "id": "CDX-04-L000048", "message_id": "CDX-04-M0006", "message_start": false, "message_role": "assistant"}]}